[{"text":"PaXC0Expand is an option for PaXEvaluate. If set to True, Package-X function C0Expand will be applied to the output of Package-X.","anchor":"paxc0expand"},{"text":"Overview, PaXEvaluate.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"PaVe[0, 0, 1, {SP[p, p], SP[p, p], m^2}, {m^2, m^2, m^2}] PaXEvaluate[%]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_{001}\\left(\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,m^2,m^2,m^2,m^2\\right)","anchor":"cb1-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"The full result is a ConditionalExpression","anchor":"cb1-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PaVe[0, 0, 1, {SP[p, p], SP[p, p], m^2}, {m^2, m^2, m^2}] res = PaXEvaluate[%, PaXC0Expand -> True];","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{C}_{001}\\left(\\overline{p}^2,\\overline{p}^2,m^2,m^2,m^2,m^2\\right)","anchor":"cb2-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"res // Short res // Last","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\fbox{$\\frac{1}{12} \\left(-\\log (4 \\pi )+\\gamma -\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon }\\right)-\\frac{1}{12} \\log \\left(\\frac{\\mu ^2}{m^2}\\right)+\\langle\\langle 6\\rangle\\rangle +\\frac{1}{6} \\log (2 \\pi )\\text{ if }m^4-\\langle\\langle 1\\rangle\\rangle >0$}\\]","anchor":"cb3-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[m^4-4 m^2 \\overline{p}^2>0\\]","anchor":"cb3-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Use Normal to get the actual expression","anchor":"cb3-2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"(res // Normal)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"}]